sic LLM-powered edit suggestions via mod-shift-e",MDInstantPreviewMode:"Enable instant preview mode",MDConsole:"IA updates to accommodate the new console page and bringing entrypoints to other pages to the top of the Object Explorer ",MDMemoryDuckDBUIDB:"Creates the _duckdb_ui database in memory instead of using or creating one on disk. For testing.",MDInstantSQLBanner:"Show the instant SQL banner",MDSemanticHighlighting:"Enable semantic highlighting for SQL queries",MDFixItV2:"Enable multi-line FixIt suggestions",MDImpersonateAccount:"Enable account impersonation for admins",MDRunOptions:"Enable the use of run options",MDChoosePlanAfterTrial:"Enable the choose plan after trial page",MDCommandMenu:"Enable the command menu (Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+P) for quick navigation and actions",MDCooldownSettings:"Enable cooldown time configuration for ducklings in the instances settings page",MDInstanceSizeInHeader:"Show the instance size picker in the header",MDMegaGigaBanner:"Show the Mega and Giga instance size banner",MDFormatterButton:"Enable the formatter button in the SQL editor",MDFormatterHotkey:"Enable the formatter hotkey in the SQL editor",MDTestS3Connection:"Enable the Test Connection button for S3 secrets",MDResetDucklingButton:"Enable the reset duckling button in the instances settings danger zone",MDSqlRun:"Enable SQL run infrastructure",MDSupportChat:"Enable the in-app support chat feature",MDFailOnNoInitialCatalog:"Fail user SQL that references a database that has no initial catalog yet",MDStorageLifecycle:"Enable storage lifecycle features including storage columns in database table and storage history details panel",MDRegion:"Enable region specifc UI features for supporting multi-region",MDTransientDB:"Enable transient storage option for MotherDuck databases",MDQuickInfo:"Enable Inline Docs panel with function documentation on hover in SQL editor",MDObjectStorageWizard:"Enable the object storage wizard",MDHighlightSqlRun:"Highlight currently running SQL statements d