-- After you run it, explore the results in the Column Explorer panel to the right.
-- Try clicking on “created_date” to see a time series chart, or “complaint_type”
-- to see what types of complaints citizens are making with the city.

SELECT created_date, agency, complaint_type, landmark, resolution_description
FROM sample_data.nyc.service_requests 
WHERE created_date >= '2021-01-01' AND created_date <= '2021-01-31';

-- For more about this sample data, see https://motherduck.com/docs/getting-started/sample-data-queries/nyc-311-data.`,exampleQueryServiceRequestsFixIt=`-- MotherDuck will suggest fixes to many common SQL errors! We call this “FixIt”
